 "verdicts": {
  "An April 2026 study of coding agents on SWE-bench Verified found input tokens, not output tokens, drive overall cost, and runs on the same task can differ by up to 30x in total tokens.": 1,
  "Anthropic's Claude Code docs state the average enterprise cost is around $13 per developer per active day and $150-250 per developer per month, below $30 per active day for 90% of users.": 1,
  "By Unblocked's arithmetic, 300 engineers at $150-250 per month is $45,000 to $75,000 a month on one tool.": 1,
  "Unblocked recommends per-user spend reports, enforced caps where tools allow them, centrally set default model and effort, and shared codebase context so agents do not rediscover the same codebase.": 1
 }
}